 "content_notes": "Tone: funny, never crude. The Miami traveller is ACCUSED only (charged by federal complaint, presumed innocent): never named, drawn only as a faceless silhouette tagged NOT A LIKENESS, and every allegation is attributed ('prosecutors say', 'allegedly'). His underwear is never shown on a body: the six tubes appear only on the inspection table. Birds, lizards and snakes are stylised, alive and unharmed; nothing is said about the birds' fate because no source reports it. The other two travellers are anonymous silhouettes (NOT A LIKENESS). Officers are generic figures with no badge, patch, flag, crest or logo of CBP, U.S. border services or China Customs; the airport, crossing and port are generic illustrations, not replicas. The customs form is our own simplified drawing, not a copy of CBP Form 6059B. No dialogue is invented. Status verified 2026-10-17.",
