   "type": "established",
   "nature": "allegation (federal criminal complaint, U.S. Attorney S.D. Florida)",
   "text": "ALLEGATION (federal complaint): a man arriving at Miami International Airport from Cuba had 10 live birds hidden in tubes sewn into his underwear, prosecutors say. Narration: '10 live birds in his underwear.' Headline '10 LIVE BIRDS / IN HIS UNDERWEAR'; label 'ALLEGED · PROSECUTORS SAY'.",
   "sources": [
    "abc",
    "gma",
    "cbs12",
    "gray",
    "wsb",
    "fox",
    "telemundo"
   ]
  },
  {
