   "type": "established",
   "nature": "allegation (editorial wording)",
   "text": "Editorial deadpan rehook (the birds were found in his underwear, not his luggage). Narration: 'Not in his bag. Inside his underwear.'",
   "sources": [
    "abc",
    "cbs12",
    "gray"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "K_where",
   "type": "established",
   "nature": "allegation (complaint) / reported fact",
   "text": "He arrived at Miami International Airport on a flight from Havana, Cuba, on Sunday 4 October 2026 (an American permanent resident). Narration: 'Prosecutors say Miami airport officers spotted a bulge.' Label 'MIAMI INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT / Sun 4 Oct 2026 · a flight from Havana'.",
   "sources": [
    "abc",
    "cbs12",
    "gray",
    "telemundo"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "K_bulge",
